figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687226412797952763015.png/UABvJCkSbDI7ae3iHhMawgF_Sq-xL5DQncTY1J3E2NQ\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687229206335488829014.png/JwipnmfRfTwXNf7SkhSdHPRD0T79xZ67_ceNTP3HjUw\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><p>陸國安部長點名AI「6大風險」！恐威脅「政治安全與意識形態」</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T11:39:07.821202+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2230,"images":25,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}